      "Variant codex ids append a star-class code (O,B,A,F,G,K,M,L,T,Y,TTS,Ae,W,D,N) or a capitalised element name before \"_Name;\", e.g. \"$Codex_Ent_Aleoids_01_A_Name;\", \"$Codex_Ent_Bacterial_04_Antimony_Name;\"."
